  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to capacity building, training and strengthening of Hellenic Rescue Team (HRT) in Greece. HRC and Redningsselskapt are working together in rescuing refugees in the Levant. Main component is training in Norway/Greece.</narrative>
